        "en": "The step-114,000 permanent checkpoint copied completion metadata successfully, then the asynchronous deletion of its temporary sibling was denied by the protected checkpoint-prefix policy and ended the training attempt. The next attempt saved temporary checkpoint 114,192 and trained through step 114,203, past the prior failure point. The investigation tied the new delete operation to PR #8974; PR #9215 merged later that day to publish remote metadata directly without delete. This confirms the incident mechanism and merged fix, not yet a production-validated checkpoint restore. Learning exercise: classify a merged fix with no later launch or restore record as code evidence, not deployment evidence.",
        "zh": "Step 114,000 permanent checkpoint 已成功复制 completion metadata，随后异步删除 temporary sibling 时被受保护 checkpoint prefix 的策略拒绝，训练 attempt 因而结束。下一次 attempt 保存 temporary checkpoint 114,192，并训练到 step 114,203，越过此前失败点。调查把新增的 delete 操作追溯到 PR #8974；PR #9215 在当天稍后合并，使 remote metadata 直接发布、不再执行 delete。这确认了 incident mechanism 与 merged fix，但还不是经过 production restore 验证的 checkpoint。小练习：如果修复已合并，却没有更晚的 launch 或 restore 记录，应把它归为 code evidence，而不是 deployment evidence。"
